<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Integrated Process.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin and Jenrette analyst Robert Maire initiated coverage of Integrated Process Equipment Corp as a buy.</p>
<p>-- set a price target of $23 a share.</p>
